            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2129",
            "content": {
                "en": "I heard Yuntai holds a festival every two years—the Qiqiao Festival. Have you heard of it?",
                "zh": "芸台似乎会每两年举行乞巧大会，您有听说过吗？",
