            "index": 27,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2130",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hmm… I think it’s pretty well-known. We usually get passengers coming for it around this time of year.",
                "zh": "唔，这个大会似乎还挺有名气的，往年也常有乘客在这个时段慕名而来。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -330.0,
            "positionY": 2150.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3ebfba84-127f-4b1f-92bc-c80dd614b8c1",
            "index": 28,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2131",
            "content": {
                "en": "Are you planning to check it out after landing?",
                "zh": "您降落之后会去大会看看吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 12.0,
            "positionY": 2150.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0c6fcd1e-0560-4c87-a879-f6717f8b8863",
            "index": 29,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2132",
            "content": {
                "en": "That’s a personal matter, miss. But I don’t like crowds, especially the noisy kind, with people like you.",
                "zh": "这就是私人安排了，女士。不过我一向不喜欢人多的地方，尤其是如您这样聒噪的人聚集的地方。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 378.0,
            "positionY": 2150.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
