            "index": 35,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2138",
            "content": {
                "en": "Alright, miss. I know what you're after. You’ve been standing here chatting with me all this time just to get an in-flight meal, right?",
                "zh": "行了女士，我也不是有意为难你，你站在这里跟我说了这么久，就是为了拿一份飞机餐吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2404.0,
            "positionY": 1840.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fcb30d9d-9acd-4d56-b4bf-2be51080e4d3",
            "index": 36,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2139",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Oh no, she saw right through me.)",
                "zh": "（糟糕，策略好像被识破了）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2756.0,
            "positionY": 1840.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "26b8ca05-b47e-4af9-960f-8b39555220ef",
            "index": 37,
            "characterId": "fe717acf-a852-4395-beb4-8cbc7dc92d14",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2140",
            "content": {
                "en": "Here. Take this and go. Don’t let the other passengers know, alright? If everyone rushes over, it’ll be a huge hassle.",
                "zh": "给，拿了这个赶快走吧。不要告诉别的乘客哦，如果所有人都一窝蜂过来的话我会很困扰的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3106.0,
            "positionY": 1840.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "324dd233-0844-4e94-a5a8-d8bf2e620e8b",
            "index": 38,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2141",
            "content": {
                "en": "Got it! Thank you so much!",
                "zh": "好的！非常感谢您！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3478.0,
            "positionY": 1840.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
